{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こたつから抜けれない。\nだめになりますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイレントマジョリティーポーズ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN22EAFAJRKZTXJGFKMPG7P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nりな、ふーちゃん と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月ですね!\nおめでたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんの家で、りおんくんと2回目の対面をしました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN22FFYQQ07KP3AV8JK0D7S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか前を向いてくれないりおんくん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN22H1DGD8E6QSCCVWY977C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとドヤ顔ぽくなってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りおんくんの毛は真っ白です!\n元気いっぱいの明るい男の子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、おばあちゃんのお雑煮。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN22JHEB7TTFWWF47E3T2C0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったなー(*´ч`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月は1年の中で、一番好きな時期です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんのお漬物をお土産にもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切に少しずつ食べます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}